      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Wan 2.2 A14B + Video Director + Instareal\n\nWhat this workflow does:\n1. Uses Video Director with model_type = wan22.\n2. Patches BOTH Wan branches with their required step-distill LoRAs at 1.0.\n3. Then applies Instareal to BOTH branches at 1.0.\n4. CLIP Vision is connected so the same workflow can handle T2V, I2V, and FFLF timeline clips.\n\nPrompting / strengths:\n- Trigger word: Instareal\n- Recommended strength is 0.8 to 1.2, with 1.0 as the starting point. This workflow uses 1.0 by default.\n- Keep Instareal in global_style or clip prompts whenever you want the realism effect.\n\nLoader note:\n- Both Q6_K model branches use UnetLoaderGGUF from ComfyUI-GGUF.\n- ComfyBox downloads the verified InstaGirl v2.5 high-noise and low-noise files under the filenames selected by this workflow.\n\nTimeline notes:\n- timeline_json starts as {}. Open the Video Director timeline UI and add your T2V, I2V, or FFLF clips there.\n"
      ],
      "title": "README — Wan22 + Instareal + Director"
    }
